# High Perfect Morcant, Llanowar Elves and Elvish Mystic make Bot2 blight three times: Sylvan Caryatid (0/3) twice and Ornithopter
# (0/2) once. Tapping the three untapped Elves (Morcant, the Elves and the Mystic, summoning sick as the cost does not care)
# proliferates: Bot1 chooses only Ornithopter, which gets a second -1/-1 counter and dies, while Caryatid stays at two counters.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
High Perfect Morcant
Black Lotus
Llanowar Elves
Elvish Mystic
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Sylvan Caryatid
Ornithopter
Island x3
Island x13

